                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I don't really play match three games, maybe some of the issues I've experienced are fairly common in the genre.\nOverall experience is pretty rough around the edges, audio is a masterclass in driving people nuts, and the gameplay becomes tedious really fast. \n\nGame uses mobile controls which are somewhat unresponsive, too many levels that feel way too long with some of them forcing you to use a specific companion whose powerups are locked behind seemingly randomly dropped items, the dialogue gameplay is autowin, and there's no way to know how many monsters are left to get rid of until you see the back wall.\n\nWith so many games available to play, there's really no reason wasting time playing this one.",
